AEMELIA; Ay, but not enough. ADRIANA; It was the copy of our conference: 
In bed he slept not for my urging it; 
At board he fed not for my urging it; 
Alone, it was the subject of my theme; 
In company I often glanced it; 
Still did I tell him it was vile and bad. AEMELIA; And thereof came it that the man was mad. The venom clamours of a jealous woman 
Poisons more deadly than a mad dog's tooth. It seems his sleeps were hinder'd by thy railing, 
And therefore comes it that his head is light. 68

